        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-09-21T16:15:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You're both right, points for everyone!</p><p>As an&nbsp;Egyptian hieroglyphic it is the word \"Life\" but as a symbol it represents eternal life. I believe it also held connections with the Nile, that which gave life to Egypt (though it has been a long time since I have looked at Egyption mythology/sybolism).</p>",
